{"title": "Dispel Evil And Good: Break Enchantment", "pageid": 22360, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dispel_Evil_And_Good:_Break_Enchantment", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 5 Spells", "Abjuration spells", "Actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Break_Enchantment.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Break_Enchantment.webp/300px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Break_Enchantment.webp, /w/images/c/c3/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Break_Enchantment.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Break_Enchantment.webp/300px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Break_Enchantment.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Break_Enchantment.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Dispel Evil And Good: Break Enchantment </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 5 abjuration spell</a>. This is only available after casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dispel_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Dispel Evil and Good\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp/25px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp/38px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp/50px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dispel Evil and Good\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp/25px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dispel_Evil_and_Good\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dispel Evil and Good\">Dispel Evil and Good</a> on yourself. This spell allows spellcasters to break enchantments cast on allies from otherworldly creatures.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nTouch a creature that is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">Charmed</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a><sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malefic_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Malefic Possession (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Possessed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malefic_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Malefic Possession (Condition)\">Possessed</a> by an otherworldly entity to free its mind.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\